---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Read Aura Living's privacy policy covering contact information, communications, and SMS." path="/privacy-policy/">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Privacy Policy" title="Your information, handled with care." intro="This draft policy is written for Aura Living and should be reviewed and finalized before a public launch." />
  <section class="section"><div class="container content-grid"><article class="content-copy">
    <p><strong>Last updated: March 2025</strong></p>
    <h2>About this policy</h2><p>This Privacy Policy explains how Aura Living (“Aura Living,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) may handle information provided through this website at {site.domain}. It is a draft for review and does not describe a live production system.</p>
    <h2>Information we may collect</h2><p>If a production contact form is connected later, we may collect information you choose to provide, such as your name, email address, phone number, inquiry type, message, and communication preferences. We may also receive basic technical information that a hosting provider typically processes to deliver a website, such as browser, device, and request information.</p>
    <h2>How we use information</h2><p>Information may be used to respond to inquiries, discuss property management or resident support, coordinate requested services, maintain records, improve the website, and communicate about a request or relationship. We do not use the contact form to send or store messages.</p>
    <h2>Communications and SMS</h2><p>If SMS is activated in the future, we will use consent-based, low-volume communications for purposes described in the <a href="/sms-terms/">SMS Terms</a>. SMS consent will not be required as a condition of purchasing services. You can opt out by replying STOP and request help by replying HELP. Message and data rates may apply. Final SMS activation depends on provider approval and carrier registration, and delivery is not guaranteed.</p>
    <h2>Service providers</h2><p>For a production website, we may use hosting, form, email, property-management, communications, analytics, or SMS providers to process information on our behalf. Providers may process information under their own terms and privacy practices. The specific providers should be added here before launch.</p>
    <h2>Security and retention</h2><p>We use reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards appropriate to the information and service. No internet transmission or storage method can be promised to be completely secure. We retain information only as long as reasonably needed for the purpose collected, ongoing service, legal obligations, dispute resolution, or recordkeeping, subject to a finalized retention schedule.</p>
    <h2>International processing</h2><p>Depending on the providers selected, information may be processed in the United States or other countries where those providers operate. Applicable safeguards and notices should be confirmed before launch.</p>
    <h2>Your choices and rights</h2><p>Depending on where you live and applicable law, you may be able to request access to, correction of, deletion of, or information about the processing of your personal information. You may also opt out of non-essential communications. Contact us to make a request; we may need to verify your identity and may have to retain certain information where the law requires it.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions or requests, contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. Mailing address: {site.address} (placeholder). Phone: {site.phone} (placeholder).</p>
    <h2>Updates</h2><p>We may update this policy as the website, services, and providers change. The effective date above will identify the latest draft.</p>
  </article><aside class="side-card"><h2>Draft for review</h2><p>Confirm the legal entity, business address, service providers, retention practices, and local privacy requirements before publishing this policy.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Contact Aura Living</a></aside></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
